/P 179 0 R
/E (I was about to post this simple thought on nostr... but my sense is that bitcoin has become quite culturally stagnant and unproductive. It cannot be ignored that bitcoin can be seen as a machine that spits out degenerate subcultures, with a cosplaying revolutionary alongside a non-confrontational Christian core and a checked out wealthy hippy culture. It is easy to look at machines; but bitcoin is bitcoin not because of code, which can be copied, but due to the human higher order cybernetic layer.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
